1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,520
Good evening, excellence…

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,030
Imagine the club president…

3
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,470
coming down to the pitch,

4
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:06,190
playing instead of the captain!

5
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,980
Strange, right?

6
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,010
But it happens in many companies.

7
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,420
Let's separate the roles:

8
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:12,720
The Board,

9
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,210
Board of Directors:

10
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,730
like the club's board…

11
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:16,710
it directs:

12
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,310
sets the strategy

13
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,730
and the big goals,

14
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,820
and it oversees:

15
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,380
holds management accountable for results.

16
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,040
Executive management,

17
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,090
Management:

18
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,990
like the coach and the team…

19
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,390
they execute on the pitch,

20
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:29,310
every day.

21
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,200
The OECD Principles

22
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,050
of Corporate Governance say:

23
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:35,560
the board's role is strategic guidance…

24
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,790
and effective monitoring of management.

25
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,720
And if the board starts approving

26
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:41,090
daily operational paperwork?

27
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:42,460
who will oversee whom?

28
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,970
Remember it this way:

29
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:45,290
Whoever oversees…

30
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:47,090
can't be the one who executes.

31
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:47,970
And you?

32
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,585
Is your board in the

33
00:00:49,585 --> 00:00:51,200
stands… or on the pitch?

34
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:52,990
Tell me in the comments

35
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,480
See you tomorrow…

36
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:56,150
on Masaa Al-Tamayoz
